  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/InaugExpoalTallOnda1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span lang=\"ca-ES-valencia\">La vesprada d&#39;aquest divendres s&#39;ha inaugurat a la Casa de la Cultura d&#39;Onda l&#39;exposici&oacute; &lsquo;Al Tall, 35 anys de m&uacute;sica mediterr&agrave;nia des del Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;&rsquo;, que restar&agrave; oberta fins diumenge 4 de mar&ccedil;. L&#39;horari &eacute;s d</span>e dilluns a dissabte, de 10.00 h a 14.00 h i de 17.30 h a 20.30 h, i diumenges d&#39;11.00 h a 14.00 hores.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/InaugExpoalTallOnda2.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span lang=\"ca-ES-valencia\">Despr&eacute;s de la inauguraci&oacute;, s&#39;ha projectat a La Cassola el documental Sempre Al Tall, un biopic de l&#39;agrupaci&oacute; musical on poden veure&#39;s els &uacute;ltims assajos, trobades, concerts i homenatges al grup.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposicioaltall/img_9878.jpg\" alt=\"img_9878\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposicioaltall/img_9879.jpg\" alt=\"img_9879\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguracioexposicioaltall/img_9884.jpg\" alt=\"img_9884\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r